{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate","id":1388184,"title":"vampire hunter D has Fangs (at the Gate)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-13T16:49:45-07:00","id":1388184,"title":"vampire hunter D has Fangs (at the Gate)","content":"So, I just got my first copy of Fangs at the gate (I skipped the earlier manuscript release figuring it'd be too rough to digest). So, I'm reading this for the first time and thought I'd share some thoughts on my first read through. up to Chapter 4 so far, but decided to start posting so my thoughts are fresh:<br /> <br /> Chapter One....nothing really new here to comment on.<br /> <br /> Chapter Two. The Silver Pact feels more like 1E than it did in 2. Also some stuff sounds familiar, but can't recall if it's stuff I'm recalling from 1E or W:tA (I uinfortunatly lost those books when I moved last to look). Like the newer Ma Ha Suchi, now he seems to have some goal to his rather violent actions (and is actually less violent and more organized). Rakshi comes off as less crazy. definite improvement. And I'm now thinking who out there would be a good Shahan-ya to some Lunars I want to make (hmm, who would teach the Lunar daughter of the Empress herself?). Sha'a Oka almost feels like Black Fang from W:tA Bastet book.<br /> <br /> Page 36, Thank ou to the artist for showing a real tyrant lizard, wth a cape of feathers down it's back <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Reading on Abyssals and Infernals though...I was under the impression they were going a different route this edition and making the origins and connects to the Solars for both vague and not set in canon. This reads a lot like they were in 2E. I hope I'm wrong in my reading though, esp with the Infernals (if we get bloated hantai-monster loli back, I swear....!)<br /> <br /> <br /> Chapter 3 I buzzed through. This kind of setting chapter I will read more indepth later since I love setting-dense stuff like this, but for now want to get a feel for the whole book. I did read over Luthe now though, since that was a 2E locatoion I really enjoyed. And now I miss the Traitorspawn <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> on Chapter 4 now, which is all crunchy stuff. So I'll back when I have more to say. <br /> <br /> But till then I just wanna say... I\u00c4! SILENT PEARL FTAGN!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 05-13-2020, 07:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T19:06:55-07:00","id":1388207,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ch 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I\u00c4! Silent Pearl Ftagn!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">New great curse seems better written than previous editions. More primal and animalistic. Though, is it bad of me that I think we needed a limit break that basically compels the Lunar to sate his sexual lust immediatly. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Laughing Devil Spirit...does the Joker have this Limit? (No, Getimian)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ch 6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vogl, in the opening artwork. I think this is one of the few times I can think of High Medieval/Crusader style armor shown. Not my preferred style, but a nice change of pace.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hybrid Body Transformation=Glabro; </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Moon-in-Well Emanation: a Charm I really want to tell some people to learn ASAP so they really can go fuck themselves <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> be back with more later (yeah, I'm drawing it out, but ye olde ADD won't let me do more in one sitting)</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T19:56:28-07:00","id":1388215,"title":"","content":"Oh, Neat! I've had the text for so long its basically soaked into my unconscious mind, so its refreshingly pleasant to ready about someone laying eyes on it for the first time.<br /> <br /> Thanks ever so much!<br /> <br /> prototype00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 05-13-2020, 11:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T20:19:56-07:00","id":1388220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate#post1388184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reading on Abyssals and Infernals though...I was under the impression they were going a different route this edition and making the origins and connects to the Solars for both vague and not set in canon. This reads a lot like they were in 2E. I hope I'm wrong in my reading though, esp with the Infernals (if we get bloated hantai-monster loli back, I swear....!)</div> </div> </div> </div>It is vague to the characters in-universe but Abyssals and Infernals are still corrupted Solar Exaltations. That's actually an important, since because they are Solar Exalations, the Deathlords and Yozi can't truly just choose whoever they want, but instead must choose from &quot;heroes and potential heroes&quot; in line with some of the Sun's tastes. Of course both Abyssals and Infernals won't just be repaints of Solars, with Abyssals only mirroring Solars in the beginning before diverging to follow the themes of death, the Underworld, and most importantly the Deathlords. Infernals are gonna diverge more earlier thanks to their Devil-Body abilities, what was formerly know as Shintai in 2e but in the specific combination you brought up, yeah that's not happening","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T14:01:33-07:00","id":1388423,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ch 6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Gotta be a better way to organize Charms. Finding ones for shapeshifting and sacred hunts all over is a bit confusing. But can't say I can think of one. Though maybe a Charm spreadsheet or chart would help\u2026.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Moonstruck Reverie Trick: </span></span><a href=\"https://youtu.be/VmZXHUukA_A\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">https://youtu.be/VmZXHUukA_A</span></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Yeah, need a final index to find all the charms that feed into each other. So many have prereqs that are not in their section of the chapter. Short of memorizing everything hard to put together stuff.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Can't really comment on many Charms as I have a weak understanding of the rules. Loving the feel of the Dexterity CV combat charms though. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Isn't Graceful Crane Stance a Solar Charm too?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cunning Anglerfish Decoy=Shadow Clone Jutsu</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I like the feel of the Intelligence Heartblood Charms. Need a way to steal knowledge without killing the target too.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Turning someone into an animal? Nice. Maybe need some expansions to this Charmtree to transform mortals into beastmen too?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Skipping the Crafting Charms. I never got the crafting rules at all</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I may skipp the rest of charms for this readthrough. hard to keep track of them or look at related/prereq ones when I have no idea where p.XX is<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T15:56:21-07:00","id":1388471,"title":"","content":"The sacred hunt charms are at the front of each attribute, so they're pretty well organised really. <br /> <br /> But yeah a cross reference for stuff that affects shapeshifting and maybe a list of what charms are totemic for each attribute would help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T16:00:46-07:00","id":1388472,"title":"","content":"But, uh...<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388423#post1388423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ch 6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Turning someone into an animal? Nice. Maybe need some expansions to this Charmtree to transform mortals into beastmen too?</span></span><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's... what that charm's prerequisite does?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T16:31:55-07:00","id":1388479,"title":"","content":"......does it? I did look back and couldn't find the prereq. or are we talking about a different one?<br /> <br /> <br /> nevermind","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T16:40:43-07:00","id":1388482,"title":"","content":"I fully expected this thread to be about D himself as a Lunar, but this is good too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T17:20:14-07:00","id":1388500,"title":"","content":"Sharing Luna's Gifts. Give a bunch of mutations from an animal to a willing recipient. <br /> <br /> Also Beast Soul Awakening Crucible, which lets you make a &quot;testing ground&quot; that turns mortals who pass the challenges into beastmen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T17:28:07-07:00","id":1388502,"title":"","content":"THIS IS WHY I NEED AN INDEX!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T17:31:31-07:00","id":1388503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388482#post1388482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I fully expected this thread to be about D himself as a Lunar, but this is good too.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> no, I'd be an Infernal and my namesake an Abysaal maybe.<br /> <br /> I do have two or three Lunars I kinda wanna make though (Saurophaganax, Lillun the Falcon Rebel, and Kerensky the Wolf Father)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-14T17:52:39-07:00","id":1388507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388207#post1388207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Though, is it bad of me that I think we needed a limit break that basically compels the Lunar to sate his sexual lust immediatly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Avaricious Horde-Beast.<br /> <br /> Which can either be expressed by (or interpreted as) a Lunar indulging in as much sex as possible with available partners... or seeking to gather so many partners that the Lunar doesn't actually stop to have sex.<br /> <br /> It's distinct from Solar Rampaging Avarice in that the Solar Virtue Flaw applies equally to all of the Solar's favorite pleasures, while the Lunar Monstrous Urge only applies to one desire at a time.<br /> <br /> Further, the Solar will resort to violence or threats of violence to take a sexual partner or a mug of ale, even if they could have paid for it. But the Lunar may pay any price without resorting to threats, and is only compelled immediately to violence if anyone tries to take the object of their fixation away from them.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Hybrid Body Transformation=Glabro </div> </div> </div>Basically, yeah.<br /> <br /> Warforms in Third Edition don't have to be any furrier than Inuyasha.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T01:42:10-07:00","id":1388601,"title":"","content":"I got an idea of using Nyx from Dragon Prince as the basis for a warform now....<br /> <br /> <br /> also, looking over Strength and Stamina now. Stamina combat oriented charms have the best feel for my Full Moon concepts. Dexterity ones for changing moon ideas. Strength, some charms go one way, other charms the other way. Just my thinking","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 05-15-2020, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T04:34:23-07:00","id":1388643,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Anyone else read this and think it was going to be a character based around Vampire Hunter D, as a Lunar with a totem of Vampire Bat? I am slightly disappointed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T08:23:37-07:00","id":1388686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388601#post1388601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I got an idea of using Nyx from Dragon Prince as the BBC asis for a warform now....</div> </div> </div> </div>Good taste. (In appearances.)<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> also, looking over Strength and Stamina now. Stamina combat oriented charms have the best feel for my Full Moon concepts. Dexterity ones for changing moon ideas. Strength, some charms go one way, other charms the other way. Just my thinking </div> </div> </div>I was very impressed by the Stamina Charm tree, which seemed to support an extremely good-natured, heroic brick, and very much distinguishes itself from the kind of aggressive character who might choose to Favor Strength instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T08:33:41-07:00","id":1388688,"title":"","content":"I don't know if the Rage tree is &quot;good-natured&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T10:23:24-07:00","id":1388710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388688#post1388688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know if the Rage tree is &amp;quot;good-natured&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Supporting and constraining are two different things.<br /> <br /> And the rage can be used to protect, can it not?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T16:18:30-07:00","id":1388785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388643#post1388643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Anyone else read this and think it was going to be a character based around Vampire Hunter D, as a Lunar with a totem of Vampire Bat? I am slightly disappointed.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s funny because D (the anime character) is a major Abyssal inspiration (Resonance in particular), but really a lot of powers traditionally associated with Dracula, or those wielded by D, or Alucard on Helsing, actually work really well for Lunars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T18:19:12-07:00","id":1388809,"title":"","content":"Is there a charm for gaining motes by drinking blood( I'm sure there is but dont have the charmset memorized)? Because if there is then we could make Lunar Vampires","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T18:45:01-07:00","id":1388817,"title":"","content":"I don't think so. There's a charm that lets you temporarily take someone's shape by drinking their blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-15T21:19:59-07:00","id":1388835,"title":"","content":"Maybe something growing off that somehow....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T04:48:20-07:00","id":1388879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388817#post1388817\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think so. There's a charm that lets you temporarily take someone's shape by drinking their blood.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is also that branch of the Intelligence(Mysticism) charm tree by which the Lunar can impart various levels of mutations or shapeshifting by <i>feeding their blood</i> to willing or unwilling subjects. Sharing Luna's Gift, Insidious Lunar Transformation, and onwards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:09:10-07:00","id":1388883,"title":"","content":"Can you tell me what Fangs at the Gate says about Lilith? I\u2019m thinking about buying it, but I want to know what it says about her first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:15:28-07:00","id":1388884,"title":"","content":"The part about the Abyssals and Infernalist sounds pretty cool though. So does the part about the super horny Lunar limit break (the moon is a symbol of female sexuality), though I would draw the line at forcing or paying someone to have sex with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:19:43-07:00","id":1388885,"title":"","content":"She was a warrior-prince of the Old Realm, who rode to war with her husband Andamani. When he was killed in the Usurpation she was heart-broken, and worked with the Silver Pact, trying to lose herself in the war with the Shogunate, but she regrets her old lifestyle of war and privelege. Over time she's engaged less and less with the world, because it reminds her too much of her dead husband.<br /> <br /> Also, her art looks way buffer than before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:37:47-07:00","id":1388888,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2402_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2402\" data-vbnamecard=\"2402\">The Wizard of Oz</a> awesome! \ud83d\ude0a She sounds great. I think I am gonna buy this book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:41:10-07:00","id":1388890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1388885#post1388885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She was a warrior-prince of the Old Realm, who rode to war with her husband Andamani. When he was killed in the Usurpation she was heart-broken, and worked with the Silver Pact, trying to lose herself in the war with the Shogunate, but she regrets her old lifestyle of war and privelege. Over time she's engaged less and less with the world, because it reminds her too much of her dead husband.</div> </div> </div> </div>To add: she was drawn back to the world when Andamani was reincarnated with the other Solars, and now seeks his reincarnation, along with looking to reconnect with the surviving Lunars she once knew.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:44:08-07:00","id":1388893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate#post1388184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reading on Abyssals and Infernals though...I was under the impression they were going a different route this edition and making the origins and connects to the Solars for both vague and not set in canon. This reads a lot like they were in 2E. I hope I'm wrong in my reading though, esp with the Infernals (if we get bloated hantai-monster loli back, I swear....!)</div> </div> </div> </div>The stuff about Abyssals and Infernals at least has some value to people who never picked up Exalted before. I was more concerned about Getimians because I was bracing myself for <b>years</b> of every fat splat feeling the need to have a paragraph on Getimians but content to dance around in circles saying nothing of value and reminding us that Rakan Thulio is a really bad dude. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T05:59:11-07:00","id":1388901,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"51\" data-vbnamecard=\"51\">marin</a> I like this version of Lilith way better than the passive victim from Dreams of the First Age.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7\" data-vbnamecard=\"7\">Lioness</a> that actually would be helpful for me. I don\u2019t know that much about Abyssals and Infernals and nothing at all about Getimians. Plus I think the Lunars themselves are a pretty cool splat.<br /> <br /> Thanks. I\u2019m defo gonna buy Fangs at the Gate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T07:32:11-07:00","id":1388937,"ti