</div>Indeed, it is at that, and also with the basic sacred hunt.<br /> <br /> Memory Drinking Meditation merely requires <i>claiming a shape</i>.<br /> <br /> Blood Geas Binding is not even a prerequisite. (Although they do go well together.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 05-16-2020, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T18:23:35-07:00","id":1389138,"title":"","content":"I give up. I cant comment on a book everyone has thoroughly memorized","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T18:30:37-07:00","id":1389142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1389138#post1389138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I give up. I cant comment on a book everyone has thoroughly memorized</div> </div> </div> </div>Could you please stop giving up on your threads a few days after starting them?<br /> <br /> \u200bI clicked this thread because I wanted to see you give your opinions and insight on Fangs at the Gate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T18:42:57-07:00","id":1389147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1389138#post1389138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I give up. I cant comment on a book everyone has thoroughly memorized</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry. If you wish people to quiet down until you've gotten through all of your own discoveries, I shall respect that.<br /> <br /> What you said before about motes for blood drinking, I could actually see something similar in terms of a Charm that recoups motes for some gesture of domination after overcoming a foe, that a given Lunar could do as consuming blood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T21:33:38-07:00","id":1389186,"title":"","content":"It's just I'm on my first cursory readthrough where I'm trying to get the gist of the various charmsets, but everybody is acting like I should already have every charm memorized <i>and</i> have a deep understanding of how they all interact, even ones dozens of pages apart. I never had that much command of the charms even back in previous editions. And it's really discouraging<br /> <br /> Add to that I am trying to do other things too, like my job. So cant put that much time into it now. And I cant get used to the feel of ebooks anyway. I think I need to be able to quickly flip back and forth between pages, not make several clicks over and over.<br /> <br /> Nevermind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T22:19:44-07:00","id":1389195,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1388184-vampire-hunter-d-has-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1389186#post1389186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">everybody is acting like I should already have every charm memorized</div> </div> </div> </div>Who is acting like that?<br /> <br /> I\u2019ll admit, I was only skimming the posts of others in this thread earlier, but none of them came across like that to me.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve gone back over the thread and reread everyone\u2019s replies; the closest thing to \u201ceveryone\u201d expecting you to have \u201cevery Charm memorized\u201d was when <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3166_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3166\" data-vbnamecard=\"3166\">Elfive</a> answered a concern you raised.<br /> <br /> I get the feeling you\u2019re reading things into people\u2019s posts, things that aren\u2019t actually there in the first place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 05-17-2020, 01:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T03:59:23-07:00","id":1389239,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d\" style=\"background-i